  "html": "<h2>The same moment, two webs</h2>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n  <figure><img src=\"media/renew-409.png\" alt=\"1997: a renewal typed by hand and refused, 409.\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>1997, the web that wasn't: typed, sent, refused.</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"media/hobbit-greyed.png\" alt=\"Today: Renew greyed, with the reason, before anything is sent.\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Today: Renew greyed, with the reason, before anything is sent.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<ul>\n  <li><b>Same library, same rules:</b> renew is refused while a hold is waiting, or after three renewals.</li>\n  <li><b>The web that wasn't:</b> a document of every address, pages of numbers, a POST typed by hand.</li>\n  <li><b>The web we got:</b> each page carries the controls its state allows.</li>\n</ul>\n",
